  "notes": "# OverCue firmware 0.14.7\n\n- Fix unwanted tempo-percentage changes when manually playing tracks with a variable beat grid.\n- Make prepared stems available before pressing PLAY, from USB/SD and linked sources.\n- Speed up iPhone stem transfers over Wi-Fi and improve waveform loading, including when stem processing finishes.\n- Make the master waveform displayed on other linked players respond to stem-volume changes for iPhone-provided tracks.\n- Keep more stem audio cached when memory allows, reducing reloading during beat jumps.\n- Report stem-audio, waveform and full-track cache readiness to compatible iPhone apps.\n",
